  "instructions": [
    "Peel the zest of one lemon off in strips, then juice both lemons to get 5 tbsp. Peel and finely chop the onions, and peel and mince the garlic.",
    "Warm the oil in a large saucepan on a medium to low heat. Add the onions, salt and lemon peel and cook, stirring, for 8 minutes, until very soft and translucent. Add the garlic and fry for a minute, until the raw smell has gone.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste and Aleppo pepper and cook for 4 to 5 minutes. Tip in the beans with their water and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Crumble in the stock cube, add the tahini, black pepper and 600ml boiling water, mix well, then simmer gently for 10 minutes. Add the lemon juice, cook for 5 more minutes and take off the heat.",
    "Toast the pine nuts in a small dry frying pan, stirring, for 4 to 5 minutes, until golden.",
    "Heat the flatbreads. Divide the beans between bowls, scatter over the pine nuts and torn basil, drizzle with olive oil and serve with the flatbreads."
  ],
